                <pb facs="0854" n="756" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg756"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.93/134: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Tenney</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-11-24T16:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 24,
                                1919—4 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received November 24—10:40
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>By Presidential mandate dated November 22nd the independence of Outer Mongolia
                    has been canceled and status of Mongolia has been restored.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tenney</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
